- No, you're very pretty.

1022
00:37:32,001 --> 00:37:34,001
KARINA, sit down and wipe the table.

1023
00:37:34,571 --> 00:37:36,440
(Sharing life wisdom with the part-timer)

1024
00:37:36,441 --> 00:37:38,341
- Wipe the table while sitting down.
- Shall I?

1025
00:37:38,641 --> 00:37:40,471
- It's not an easy job, is it?
- It's not easy.

1026
00:37:40,571 --> 00:37:42,211
I've been doing this for days.

1027
00:37:42,481 --> 00:37:43,611
What's the date today?

1028
00:37:44,041 --> 00:37:46,811
- What? She lost track of time.
- Oh, no.

1029
00:37:47,251 --> 00:37:49,120
- Today is the 17th.
- The 17th?

1030
00:37:49,121 --> 00:37:51,521
It's the 17th? It's year 2024, right?

1031
00:37:52,891 --> 00:37:54,591
(Laughing)

1032
00:37:54,791 --> 00:37:55,961
That's a completely different genre.

1033
00:37:57,761 --> 00:38:00,991
That's how badly we're living in rice cake inferno every day.

1034
00:38:01,931 --> 00:38:04,801
And the head chef is way too obsessed with sales.

1035
00:38:05,401 --> 00:38:07,031
Don't you work with her?

1036
00:38:07,301 --> 00:38:09,171
The head chef has it even worse downstairs.

1037
00:38:09,471 --> 00:38:10,701
- She's struggling more than me.
- She's crying.

1038
00:38:10,941 --> 00:38:12,270
- Isn't it chaotic?
- She's crying.

1039
00:38:12,271 --> 00:38:13,271
She's crying.

1040
00:38:13,571 --> 00:38:15,540
We'll get going now.

1041
00:38:15,541 --> 00:38:16,641
(They finish cleaning the table with a small talk.)

1042
00:38:16,881 --> 00:38:19,281
Take a look around and see if anyone needs anything.

1043
00:38:20,211 --> 00:38:21,950
Nothing has been served to Table One.

1044
00:38:21,951 --> 00:38:24,651
Go downstairs and see if food is ready for Table One.

1045
00:38:25,121 --> 00:38:27,850
- Could you talk like this, KARINA?
- Okay.

1046
00:38:27,851 --> 00:38:29,191
Thank you.

1047
00:38:29,891 --> 00:38:31,220
Welcome, customers.

1048
00:38:31,221 --> 00:38:33,290
This is Space Rice Cake.

1049
00:38:33,291 --> 00:38:34,291
(Current time, 7:50pm)

1050
00:38:34,431 --> 00:38:35,800
Nice to meet you.

1051
00:38:35,801 --> 00:38:38,301
Welcome to Space Rice Cake.

1052
00:38:38,801 --> 00:38:41,431
Hello, everyone. Whenever you have time,

1053
00:38:41,771 --> 00:38:43,970
feel free to look around the pop-up store.

1054
00:38:43,971 --> 00:38:47,310
It's very nice to take photos in here.

1055
00:38:47,311 --> 00:38:48,711
One, two, three.

1056
00:38:49,081 --> 00:38:50,841
Sir, please open up your chest.

1057
00:38:51,681 --> 00:38:53,311
One, two, three.

1058
00:38:53,911 --> 00:38:55,851
You're a beautiful family.

1059
00:38:56,551 --> 00:38:57,920
Please go upstairs.

1060
00:38:57,921 --> 00:39:00,151
Feel free to come downstairs and take a look around.

1061
