- No.

1063
00:39:04,261 --> 00:39:05,321
What's the order?

1064
00:39:05,561 --> 00:39:08,330
- One potato cream tteoksagna, - Mimi.

1065
00:39:08,331 --> 00:39:10,160
- one tteokbokki, - Yes.

1066
00:39:10,161 --> 00:39:11,731
and one shrimp burger.

1067
00:39:12,061 --> 00:39:14,831
A burger? Mimi, fry the shrimp patty first.

1068
00:39:15,471 --> 00:39:17,671
I'll be making rice cake buns.

1069
00:39:18,001 --> 00:39:19,340
(She finishes it at the right time.)

1070
00:39:19,341 --> 00:39:20,710
Tteokbokki is ready.

1071
00:39:20,711 --> 00:39:22,240
We have an order.

1072
00:39:22,241 --> 00:39:23,910
One soda, one pomegranate ade,

1073
00:39:23,911 --> 00:39:25,910
one carrot cake, one tteoksagna,

1074
00:39:25,911 --> 00:39:28,010
one tteokbokki, one beef burger,

1075
00:39:28,011 --> 00:39:29,180
and one shrimp burger.

1076
00:39:29,181 --> 00:39:31,821
It must be the last order of the day. Isn't that right?

1077
00:39:32,551 --> 00:39:33,991
It's a jackpot at the end.

1078
00:39:34,991 --> 00:39:37,790
Burgers are already out, so take a look.

1079
00:39:37,791 --> 00:39:39,330
Yes, burgers are ready.

1080
00:39:39,331 --> 00:39:42,361
