1086
00:39:55,471 --> 00:39:57,940
Yu Jin, carrot cakes... You're doing well.

1087
00:39:57,941 --> 00:40:00,450
- Two are ready.
- That's great.

1088
00:40:00,451 --> 00:40:01,551
(2 carrot cakes are ready.)

1089
