Everything went out for Table One.

1090
00:40:04,381 --> 00:40:06,490
- Well done.
- Well done.

1091
00:40:06,491 --> 00:40:09,361
- One more carrot cake...
- I think it's for this table.

1092
00:40:09,691 --> 00:40:12,361
(However...)

1093
