However, there are two.

1094
00:40:14,561 --> 00:40:17,561
I'll serve 2 carrot cakes to Table 10.

1095
00:40:17,801 --> 00:40:20,901
Eun Ji, could you serve other tables at the same time?

1096
00:40:21,371 --> 00:40:23,401
