1097
00:40:24,571 --> 00:40:27,070
- Two for Table Ten.
- Never mind.

1098
00:40:27,071 --> 00:40:29,011
(She discards the order again.)

1099
00:40:29,481 --> 00:40:30,541
It's okay

1100
00:40:31,141 --> 00:40:34,351
