1104
00:40:46,891 --> 00:40:48,890
The burgers will be coming out a little late...

1105
00:40:48,891 --> 00:40:50,061
- Take your time.
- because of the buns.

1106
00:40:50,301 --> 00:40:54,231
(Yu Jin is in charge of carrot cake.)

1107
00:40:54,431 --> 00:40:57,540
I'll give you some ghee butter.

1108
00:40:57,541 --> 00:40:59,040
Here's some ghee butter.

1109
00:40:59,041 --> 00:41:00,041
(Young Ji is feeding the rice cake buns.)

1110
00:41:00,471 --> 00:41:03,311
(Mimi who has a million things to do)

1111
00:41:04,111 --> 00:41:07,051
