1134
00:42:00,631 --> 00:42:02,031
Shall I bring another container?

1135
00:42:02,371 --> 00:42:03,940
It's just below the table.

1136
00:42:03,941 --> 00:42:06,341
- You're so quick.
- Thank you.

1137
00:42:06,441 --> 00:42:08,110
KARINA, you work so fast.

1138
00:42:08,111 --> 00:42:10,541
- Let's call her back tomorrow.
- I hope she comes back tomorrow.

1139
00:42:10,641 --> 00:42:12,080
- Come every day.
- Can you sleep...

1140
00:42:12,081 --> 00:42:13,511
at our place tonight?

1141
00:42:13,611 --> 00:42:14,650
