1142
00:42:14,651 --> 00:42:15,921
Please, KARINA.

1143
00:42:16,381 --> 00:42:18,281
- She will never agree to it.
- She's not answering.

1144
00:42:18,421 --> 00:42:20,190
(She doesn't say things that she doesn't mean.)

1145
00:42:20,191 --> 00:42:21,251
She's brutally honest.

1146
00:42:21,921 --> 00:42:22,960
(The last dessert gets ready.)

1147
00:42:22,961 --> 00:42:24,321
One carrot cake is ready.

1148
00:42:25,061 --> 00:42:27,691
Let the customers eat tteokbokki while it's hot.

1149
00:42:27,831 --> 00:42:28,831
Okay.

1150
00:42:28,832 --> 00:42:31,001
- Tteokbokki is coming now.
- Okay.

1151
00:42:32,301 --> 00:42:33,670
The beef will be ready soon.

1152
00:42:33,671 --> 00:42:35,471
- We can serve them together.
- That's great.

1153
00:42:35,671 --> 00:42:37,141
Catharsis.

1154
00:42:37,871 --> 00:42:41,141
Catharsis. Cathar is my sister.

1155
00:42:41,241 --> 00:42:42,310
It's for Table Three.

1156
00:42:42,311 --> 00:42:45,181
