Table 8 is missing 1 ade, 1 Coke, and 1 carrot cake.

1166
00:43:08,701 --> 00:43:10,640
One ade, one Coke, and one carrot cake.

1167
00:43:10,641 --> 00:43:11,801
That's not for us.

1168
00:43:12,501 --> 00:43:14,570
