1169
00:43:14,571 --> 00:43:17,040
- Did you say carrot cake?
- I'll make the ade.

1170
00:43:17,041 --> 00:43:19,451
One ade, one Coke, and one carrot cake.

1171
00:43:19,711 --> 00:43:21,250
If they didn't go out, why did someone...

1172
00:43:21,251 --> 00:43:22,751
