- I wonder why.

1173
00:43:22,851 --> 00:43:26,851
(Why did you take it off?)

1174
00:43:27,391 --> 00:43:29,220
(The missing carrot cake remains a mystery to Eun Ji.)

1175
00:43:29,221 --> 00:43:30,261
I have no idea.

1176
00:43:31,321 --> 00:43:32,590
(The part-timer is making a pomegranate ade.)

1177
00:43:32,591 --> 00:43:34,431
We have a highly skilled new recruit.

1178
00:43:35,161 --> 00:43:36,961
It's a coming-of-age story.

1179
00:43:37,361 --> 00:43:38,801
Thank you.

1180
00:43:39,301 --> 00:43:40,971
(Walking awkwardly)

1181
00:43:41,171 --> 00:43:43,341
Did you not get your carrot cake yet?

1182
00:43:44,071 --> 00:43:46,070
I packed it generously...

1183
00:43:46,071 --> 00:43:47,610
as a little apology.

1184
00:43:47,611 --> 00:43:49,270
- Thank you.
- I'm sorry.

1185
00:43:49,271 --> 00:43:50,281
It's okay.

1186
00:43:50,381 --> 00:43:52,280
(Table 1 order)

1187
00:43:52,281 --> 00:43:53,311
Is it for them?

1188
00:43:53,581 --> 00:43:57,121
