1189
00:43:57,621 --> 00:44:00,150
Take a quick break, stand up, and look at the sky.

1190
00:44:00,151 --> 00:44:03,221
Let's do the new millennium gymnastics starting with the neck.

1191
00:44:03,621 --> 00:44:07,031
One, two, three, four,

1192
00:44:07,291 --> 00:44:10,600
five, six, seven, eight.

1193
00:44:10,601 --> 00:44:13,631
Two, two, three, four,

1194
00:44:13,931 --> 00:44:17,041
five, six. Grab a woman next to you.

1195
00:44:17,271 --> 00:44:19,440
With the woman in front of you...

1196
00:44:19,441 --> 00:44:20,441
(The essence of stretching)

1197
00:44:20,442 --> 00:44:22,340
- With her in front of you...
- It's strange with three people.

1198
00:44:22,341 --> 00:44:24,241
Playing with fire

1199
00:44:25,141 --> 00:44:27,610
(Playing with fire)

1200
00:44:27,611 --> 00:44:29,150
- Playing with fire - Playing with fire

1201
00:44:29,151 --> 00:44:30,850
- This is terrible.
- It's the last one.

1202
00:44:30,851 --> 00:44:32,381
- I don't want to join them.
- It's the last one.

1203
00:44:32,821 --> 00:44:34,521
- Do something - Do something

1204
00:44:35,851 --> 00:44:37,660
- Thank you so much for coming.
- Thank you.

1205
00:44:37,661 --> 00:44:39,690
Your clothes are getting undone...

1206
00:44:39,691 --> 00:44:42,560
- My goodness.
- because you worked so hard.

1207
00:44:42,561 --> 00:44:44,600
Yu Ji Min

1208
00:44:44,601 --> 00:44:46,230
Yu Ji Min

1209
00:44:46,231 --> 00:44:47,470
We look quite shabby, but shall we take...

1210
00:44:47,471 --> 00:44:48,731
- a commemorative photo?
- That sounds good.

1211
00:44:48,831 --> 00:44:49,900
Where?

1212
00:44:49,901 --> 00:44:50,970
(A commemorative photo is a must.)

1213
00:44:50,971 --> 00:44:52,671
Hold it right there. One, two, three.

1214
00:44:54,341 --> 00:44:55,871
(With their first part-timer)

1215
00:44:56,911 --> 00:44:59,311
(Thank you, KARINA.)

1216
00:44:59,880 --> 00:45:01,479
- Well done.
- Thank you, KARINA.

1217
00:45:01,504 --> 00:45:02,914
- Well done.
- Hurry and go home.

1218
00:45:02,981 --> 00:45:04,750
- Go home.
- Hurry and go home.

1219
00:45:04,751 --> 00:45:07,620
- KARINA.
- Thank you.

1220
00:45:07,621 --> 00:45:09,720
I'm leaving. I'll leave without a second thought.

1221
00:45:09,721 --> 00:45:11,760
- Walk her out, Yu Jin.
- Well done.

1222
00:45:11,761 --> 00:45:12,761
I'm leaving too.

1223
00:45:12,861 --> 00:45:15,890
- Let's go. Take care, KARINA.
- Bye.

1224
00:45:15,891 --> 00:45:17,361
- Bye.
- I'll miss you.

1225
00:45:17,401 --> 00:45:18,401
Goodbye.

1226
00:45:18,402 --> 00:45:19,470
(The first part-timer at Space Rice Cake leaves.)

1227
00:45:19,471 --> 00:45:21,070
- Take care.
- I'll call you.

1228
00:45:21,071 --> 00:45:22,130
Do something.

1229
00:45:22,131 --> 00:45:24,570
(The first part-timer at Space Rice Cake leaves.)

1230
00:45:24,571 --> 00:45:26,000
Gosh, KARINA.

1231
00:45:26,001 --> 00:45:27,271
(The first part-timer at Space Rice Cake leaves.)

1232
00:45:28,371 --> 00:45:31,941
(One by one, the customers get ready to leave.)

1233
00:45:32,481 --> 00:45:33,481
What's his name?

1234
00:45:33,881 --> 00:45:35,811
- His name is Ha Ru.
- Ha Ru.

1235
00:45:36,551 --> 00:45:38,580
Mother finger, mother finger

1236
00:45:38,581 --> 00:45:40,321
Where are you?

1237
00:45:41,221 --> 00:45:42,450
(Crying)

1238
00:45:42,451 --> 00:45:43,521
I'm sorry.

1239
00:45:43,721 --> 00:45:45,790
