1242
00:45:50,461 --> 00:45:51,960
Let's go and clean up.

1243
00:45:51,961 --> 00:45:53,431
- Okay.
- Let's go.

1244
00:45:53,831 --> 00:45:54,831
(It's time to clean up.)

1245
00:45:54,832 --> 00:45:56,701
- We can do it.
- We can do it.

1246
00:45:57,071 --> 00:45:58,071
Okay.

1247
00:45:58,971 --> 00:46:00,711
Mimi, look at this.

1248
00:46:02,771 --> 00:46:03,840
They finished everything.

1249
00:46:03,841 --> 00:46:04,881
