1674
01:00:34,051 --> 01:00:35,081
- Chorizo slices.
- Right.

1675
01:00:35,451 --> 01:00:36,980
Next, mushrooms.

1676
01:00:36,981 --> 01:00:37,981
- Mushrooms.
- Mushrooms.

1677
01:00:38,281 --> 01:00:39,521
