1689
01:00:59,471 --> 01:01:00,670
We'll chant first.

1690
01:01:00,671 --> 01:01:02,070
- Honesty, humility, - Humility,

1691
01:01:02,071 --> 01:01:03,341
- ahk.
- ahk.

1692
