- Yu Jin didn't chant.
- I did say, "ahk."

1693
01:01:05,941 --> 01:01:06,981
(Hurriedly)

1694
01:01:07,151 --> 01:01:09,180
How much should one lump...

1695
01:01:09,181 --> 01:01:10,950
