- But when we put it...

1740
01:02:36,001 --> 01:02:37,200
on here like this, it'll be okay.

1741
01:02:37,201 --> 01:02:39,501
Gosh. You're doing great, Mimi. It's nice and even.

1742
01:02:40,171 --> 01:02:42,070
- Is it okay?
- It's great. It's smooth.

1743
01:02:42,071 --> 01:02:44,181
